OL,3,GNEWSAFallen tree from cathedral grounds
OL,4,Ablocks road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large tree has fallen across a street
OL,7,Fin Chelmsford city centre.
OL,9,FFoliage blocked the road at the corner
OL,10,Fof Waterloo Lane and New Street on
OL,11,FSunday morning.
OL,13,FChelmsford City Council confirmed it
OL,14,Fhad fallen from the grounds of the
OL,15,Fcathedral and said its parks team was
OL,16,Fworking to get the road cleared "as
OL,17,Fsoon as possible".
OL,19,F"If you're currently parked in Waterloo
OL,20,FLane, an alternative exit on to
OL,21,FVictoria Road is available," the
OL,22,Fauthority said.
